@startuml F1.13-D01-listar-estagios
title F1.13-D01 — Listar estágios
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "InternshipsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /estagios
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /estagios?aluno=me
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT estágios
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200
note right of WebApp
  Sem _links.novo
  (abertura pela secretaria)
end note
WebApp --> Aluno: tabela ou EmptyState

@enduml
